{"type":"message","id":"266385ab","parentId":"cfbf0acb","timestamp":"2026-04-08T01:00:01.906Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:488d025f-33cc-4322-8bcb-feba06471bf1 每日行业信息搜索] 执行外网搜索任务：\n1. 搜索酒店行业最新动态（携程、美团、飞猪等）\n2. 搜索AI Agent最新技术/产品\n3. 搜索德拢集团相关新闻\n4. 提炼3条最重要信息\n5. 更新到 memory/2026-04-07.md\n\n目标：保持对行业动态的持续关注\nCurrent time: Wednesday, April 8th, 2026 - 9:00 AM (Asia/Shanghai) / 2026-04-08 01:00 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1775610001894}}
{"type":"message","id":"ed68b4db","parentId":"266385ab","timestamp":"2026-04-08T01:00:54.458Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nGot it, let's tackle this task step by step. First, I need to perform three web searches: hotel industry updates, AI Agent tech/products, and DeLong Group news. Then提炼 three key points and update the memory file. \n\nFirst, I should use the web_search tool for each query. Let's list the queries:\n\n1. 酒店行业最新动态 携程 美团 飞猪 2026年4月\n2. AI Agent 最新技术 产品 2026年4月\n3. 德拢集团 最新新闻 2026年4月\n\nWait, the user mentioned \"德拢集团\"—I need to make sure the query is correct. Let's confirm the spelling, but assuming it's correct, proceed. \n\nEach web_search call needs a query, maybe set count to 5 for each to get enough info. Let's do parallel calls since they are independent. \n\nThen, after getting the results, I need to analyze and pick the top 3 important points. Then write to memory/2026-04-07.md (wait, current date is April 8, but the cron task says update to 2026-04-07.md—maybe it's a daily task that runs on the 8th for the 7th? Or maybe a typo, but follow the task instruction: update to memory/2026-04-07.md). \n\nSo first step: call web_search three times in parallel for the three queries. Let's structure the function calls.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_qmumv7xbpergof26kwz62h7i","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"酒店行业最新动态 携程 美团 飞猪 2026年4月","count":5}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_yw7e04j89zzuyt68ux0q33rt","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"AI Agent 最新技术 产品 2026年4月","count":5}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_t03yycpvv415rbc2lokl12cm","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"德拢集团 最新新闻 2026年4月","count":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":38441,"output":456,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38897,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","