run the command? Because the skill says \"provides search-summary command for web search with AI-generated summaries\". \n\nAh right! The miaoda-web-search skill uses the exec tool to run the \"search-summary\" command. So I should use exec to run that command for each query. Let's confirm: the skill's description says \"Use when user needs to search the web for information by keywords. Provides search-summary command for web search with AI-generated summaries.\" So yes, the way to use it is to run the \"search-summary\" command via exec. \n\nSo for each query, I need to execute the search-summary command. Let's structure the exec commands: \n\nFor hotel industry: exec command \"search-summary '酒店行业最新动态 携程 美团 飞猪 2026年4月'\"\nFor AI Agent: exec command \"search-summary 'AI Agent 最新技术 产品 2026年4月'\"\nFor 德拢集团: exec command \"search-summary '德拢集团 最新新闻 2026年4月'\"\n\nBut wait, do I need to run them in parallel? The previous web_search calls were parallel, so maybe run all three via exec in parallel. Let's do that. \n\nSo the next step is to call exec three times, each with the respective search-summary command.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fbd203eu5n6kprhm3s3akor1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"search-summary '酒店行业最新动态 携程 美团 飞猪 2026年4月'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_mtejtkts2nataoytu5w1e36d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"search-summary 'AI Agent 最新技术 产品 2026年4月'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_cheqhn741cvyupjbjn92tz67","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"search-summary '德拢集团 最新新闻 2026年4月'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":38704,"output":854,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39558,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775610054732,"responseId":"chatcmpl-1ae3d2bb-8592-4053-af12-a01575cdc90a"}}
