{"type":"message","id":"f6c3a5ac","parentId":"5e956f32","timestamp":"2026-04-08T01:02:23.098Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nGot it, let's see. The user's cron task is to search three things: hotel industry updates, AI Agent tech/products, and 德拢集团 news, then提炼3条最重要信息 and update to memory/2026-04-07.md. \n\nFirst, the web_search tool failed for all three queries. Then trying exec with search-summary also failed because the command isn't found. \n\nWait, looking back at the available skills, there's a miaoda-web-search skill which uses the search-summary command? Wait no, the miaoda-web-search skill's description says it provides search-summary command for web search with AI-generated summaries. Oh right, but maybe I need to use the skill's tool instead of exec? Wait no, the available tools list doesn't have a search-summary tool, but the miaoda-web-search skill's location is there. Wait, but according to the system prompt, when a skill applies, I should read its SKILL.md first. \n\nWait the user's task is to do web searches for those three topics. The miaoda-web-search skill is for web search by keywords, using search-summary. But earlier when I tried exec search-summary it failed. Maybe I need to use the skill's tool? Wait no, looking at the tools list again—wait, the tools list includes \"web_search\" (DuckDuckGo) which failed, and there's also \"miaoda-web-search\" as a skill, but the tools list doesn't have a tool named miaoda-web-search. Wait wait, let's check the available skills again: yes, there's a miaoda-web-search skill with description \"Use when user needs to search the web for information by keywords. Provides search-summary command for web search with AI-generated summaries.\" \n\nBut how to call it? Oh wait, maybe the skill's tool is the search-summary command, but since exec can't find it, maybe I need to use the skill's specific tool? Wait no, the system prompt says that skills provide specialized instructions, so I should read the SKILL.md for miaoda-web-search first. \n\nWait the system prompt says: Before replying, scan available_skills. If exactly one skill clearly applies, read its SKILL.md. The miaoda-web-search skill applies here because the user needs to search the web for those keywords. So I should first read the SKILL.md for miaoda-web-search to know how to use it. \n\nAh right! I forgot to read the skill's SKILL.md before trying to use the command. So the next step is to read the SKILL.md for miaoda-web-search to get the correct way to perform the search.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ivu60b9om72ms2i68pqgiu5j","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/workspace/agent/skills/miaoda-web-search/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":38922,"output":591,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39513,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775610116782,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a01331d6-21ee-40bc-a4f5-21a24c310ebc"}}
{"type":"message","id":"0cc64e16","parentId":"f6c3a5ac","timestamp":"2026-04-08T01:02:23.103Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ivu60b9om72ms2i68pqgiu5j","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\r\nname: miaoda-web-search\r\ndescription: \"Use when user needs to search the web for information by keywords. Provides search-summary command for web search with AI-generated summaries. 触发词：搜索, 网页搜索, 搜一下, 查一下, web search, 搜索摘要, 查资料, 搜索引擎, search\"\r\noverride-tools:\r\n  - web_search\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Web Search\r\n\r\n通过 `miaoda-studio-cli search-summary` 按关键词搜索互联网信息，由 AI 自动总结。\r\n\r\n## Quick Reference\r\n\r\n| 参数 | 说明 | 必需 | 默认值 |\r\n|------|------|------|--------|\r\n| `--query` | 搜索关键词（1-500 字符） | 是 | - |\r\n| `--instruction` | AI 处理指令 | 否 | - |\r\n| `--output, -o` | 输出格式: text/json | 否 | text |\r\n\r\n## 命令选择决策树\r\n\r\n```\r\n用户想获取互联网信息\r\n├─ 有具体 URL → miaoda-studio-cli web-crawl（见 miaoda-web-fetch skill）\r\n├─ 无具体 URL，需搜索 → miaoda-studio-cli search-summary\r\n└─ 先搜索再深入 → search-summary 获取 URL → web-crawl 提取详情（见 miaoda-web-fetch skill）\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 使用示例\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# 按关键词搜索\r\nmiaoda-studio-cli search-summary --query \"React 19 新特性\" --instruction \"按功能分类整理，标注稳定性状态\"\r\n\r\n# 搜索并获取 JSON 输出\r\nmiaoda-studio-cli search-summary --query \"ByteDance 开源项目\" --output json\r\n```\r\n\r\n## --instruction 编写指南\r\n\r\n| 场景 | instruction 示例 |\r\n|------|-----------------|\r\n| 按条件筛选 | `\"只保留 2024 年之后发布的内容\"` |\r\n| 对比分析 | `\"对比各方案的优缺点，给出推荐\"` |\r\n| 翻译总结 | `\"用中文总结主要观点\"` |\r\n| 不指定（默认） | AI 自动总结主要信息 |\r\n\r\n## Common Mistakes\r\n\r\n| 错误 | 正确做法 |\r\n|------|----------|\r\n| 无具体 URL 时用 `miaoda-studio-cli web-crawl` | 无 URL 用 `miaoda-studio-cli search-summary`，有 URL 用 `miaoda-studio-cli web-crawl`（见 miaoda-web-fetch skill） |\r\n| `--instruction` 过于笼统（如\"总结一下\"） | 明确指定提取目标、输出格式、筛选条件 |\r\n| 搜索关键词超过 500 字符 | 提炼核心关键词，保持精简 |\r\n| 需要后续程序处理结果但未加 `--output json` | 需要解析结果时始终加 `--output json` |\r\n| 命令失败后不检查退出码 | 退出码 `1` 表示失败，检查参数和网络后重试 |\r\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775610143103}}
{"type":"message","id":"2a8afde3","parentId":"0cc64e16","timestamp":"2026-04-08T01:03:00.693Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nGot it, let's see. The user's task is to do three web searches: hotel industry updates, AI Agent latest tech/products, and Delong Group news, then提炼 three key points and update to memory. \n\nFirst, the previous web_search tool calls failed (fetch failed), then tried exec search-summary which wasn't found. Then read the miaoda-web-search SKILL.md, which says to use miaoda-studio-cli search-summary with --query. \n\nSo now I need to use the correct command from the skill: miaoda-studio-cli search-summary with the appropriate queries. Let's structure each search with the right parameters. For each of the three topics, run the miaoda-studio-cli command with the query. \n\nWait, the skill says the command is miaoda-studio-cli search-summary --query \"...\" So I should call exec with those commands. Let's make sure each query is correctly formatted. \n\nFor the hotel industry: query is \"酒店行业最新动态 携程 美团 飞猪 2026年4月\"\nAI Agent: \"AI Agent 最新技术 产品 2026年4月\"\nDelong Group: \"德拢集团 最新新闻 2026年4月\"\n\nAlso, maybe add --instruction to ask for concise summaries since we need to提炼 three key points later. Let's include that. \n\nSo the exec commands should be:\n\n1. miaoda-studio-cli search-summary --query \"酒店行业最新动态 携程 美团 飞猪 2026年4月\" --instruction \"总结2026年4月酒店行业的最新动态，重点关注携程、美团、飞猪的举措\"\n2. miaoda-studio-cli search-summary --query \"AI Agent 最新技术 产品 2026年4月\" --instruction \"总结2026年4月AI Agent领域的最新技术突破和产品发布\"\n3. miaoda-studio-cli search-summary --query \"德拢集团 最新新闻 2026年4月\" --instruction \"总结2026年4月德拢集团的最新新闻，包括业务动态、合作等\"\n\nThese commands should get the required information. Then after getting the results, I can process them to extract the three most important points and write to the memory file.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_p2bfj2z5nur7esoutyqfsedo","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"miaoda-studio-cli search-summary --query '酒店行业最新动态 携程 美团 飞猪 2026年4月' --instruction '总结2026年4月酒店行业的最新动态，重点关注携程、美团、飞猪的举措'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_armnrh1a4iwr96g1ncn573m9","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"miaoda-studio-cli search-summary --query 'AI Agent 最新技术 产品 2026年4月' --instruction '总结2026年4月AI Agent领域的最新技术突破和产品发布'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c48f5ps62gccgqx90zio0teq","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"miaoda-studio-cli search-summary --query '德拢集团 最新新闻 2026年4月' --instruction '总结2026年4月德拢集团的最新新闻，包括业务动态、合作等'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":39632,"output":736,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40368,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775610143104,"responseId":"chatcmpl-96b6d9b5-2e82-4473-b557-76327f4189dc"}}
